          <Textbox Name="Textbox27">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>G. Loan Agreement &amp; Declaration</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style>
                  <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                </Style>
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox1</rd:DefaultName>
            <Top>19.64725cm</Top>
            <Left>0.52173cm</Left>
            <Height>0.70583cm</Height>
            <Width>19.71496cm</Width>
            <ZIndex>39</ZIndex>
            <Style>
              <Border>
                <Style>None</Style>
              </Border>
              <VerticalAlign>Middle</VerticalAlign>
              <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
              <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
              <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
              <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
            </Style>
          </Textbox>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox22">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>In consideration of the Society granting the amount applied, I hereby declare as follows;
 
1. That I am a member of Kenpipe Sacco Society Ltd. 
2. That my deposits plus those of my guarantors are sufficient to cover the loan applied for (where applicable) 
3. That my present and future employers have the authority to deduct from my salary every month such a sum of money consisting of principle loan repayment and interest as may be determined by Kenpipe Sacco Ltd until the loan is repaid in full. 
4. That in the event I leave the services of my present employer, any sum of money due to me from the said employer for whatever purpose may be utilized to the extent necessary to liquidate any balance remaining in my loan account. 
5. That this authority is unconditional and may not be revoked during the life of the loan without express consent of Kenpipe Sacco Society Ltd as well as my guarantors. 
6. That the forgoing particulars are true and the best of my knowledge. 
7. I agree to abide by all the terms and conditions as contained in the Sacco’s Credit Policy. 
8. I allow Kenpipe Sacco to refer my credit status from a registered Credit Reference Bureau during loan appraisal. In the event that I default in servicing my loan herein, the Society reserves the right to share my Credit information with other financial institutions and licensed Credit Reference Bureaus, subject to applicable law. I warrant that in the event of such disclosure stated above, I shall have no claim against the Society, or any of its officers, servants or directors. 
9. I allow Kenpipe Sacco to transfer my defaulted loans to a registered Debt Collection Agency for collection as per applicable law. 
10. I provide my formal consent for Kenpipe DT Sacco Ltd to engage with my current employer on any matters related to the processing of my loan application. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
            <rd:DefaultName>Textbox22</rd:DefaultName>
