          <Textbox Name="Textbox34">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>It is hereby mutually agreed and declared that the following terms and conditions shall, in addition to the foregoing, apply to this agreement; </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>
1. The loan amount in this agreement shall be available to the borrower on completion to the satisfactory of the Sacco of all formalities appertaining to the Security of the loan. 
2. The Sacco reserves the right to change the rate of interest and/or the basis on which it is calculated 
3. The loan repayment frequency shall be once a month unless otherwise stated. 
4. Fees and charges to cover administrative costs shall be paid by the borrower. Such fees and charges will be in accordance with the prevailing Sacco Tariffs. 
5. The Sacco reserves the right to accept or decline an application with reasons.
</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
